# CMDEDIT-PAINT-11: metal1 and metal2 overlap; contact m2c; contact erase m2c; contact metal1.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 6 10
paint metal1
box 3 0 10 10
paint metal2
box 0 0 10 10
contact m2c
save c1
contact erase m2c
save c2
contact metal1
